	// Code Machine-readable outcome, present exactly when status is "error". Clients must treat a missing or unknown code as the pre-contract behaviour (an older server, e.g. after a rollback, omits it). actor_mismatch = the item's capture-time envelope did not match the authenticated caller (A04). offline_expired = the item was captured more than 12 h after the tablet's last online contact (A05); it goes to review.
